    "message": "Parallel helper: one thread in already-started workers; eight chunks per socket worker too\n\nWorkers of a param that was already running set one BLAS and OpenMP thread themselves before their first task\n(settings changed in this session can't reach them). The eight-chunks-per-worker default now also applies to\nsocket workers.\nlisa() and lisaClust() accept any BiocParallel param (socket params were rejected), and a number of cores gives\nsocket workers on Windows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y1PuRkfDQ3ApzuNoe5ovxW\n",
    "time": 1791942863
